/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4663230,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4663230-1846651706690576","game_id":"steam-4663230","kind":"update","title":"Alarm Update & Next Fest!","summary":"Hamllo!It’s already been almost three weeks since we opened the demo.Thanks to all of your love and support, the number of players who have tried the demo has now reached 1,000!(hamster applause)Today, we’d like to share some news about new features added based on your feedback, as well as our participation in Steam Next Fest.\\We received many requests for a more noticeable notification when the Focus Mode timer ends and Break Mode begins.Now, when Break Mode starts, your custom text and alarm s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:44:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690576","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4663230-1846018067934798","game_id":"steam-4663230","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.1b","summary":"Hamllo!A huge thank you to all 1,500 Hamster Masters who have downloaded the demo!We’re keeping a close eye on the Steam Community, and we’re also collecting your feedback and bug reports through our Discord.Thanks to all of you, we’ve been able to discover useful quality-of-life features and issues that we hadn’t thought of ourselves!We plan to improve them all before the full release, so please keep sending us your feedback.Here are the fixes included up through today’s v0.1b update:Fixed an i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T21:59:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934798","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4663230-1845383656380688","game_id":"steam-4663230","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Out Now!","summary":"Ham-hello!The Hamster Time demo is out today!Hamster Time is a cute, lightweight game you can keep running on your desktop while you get other things done.Here’s what you’ll find in the demo:26 Common-tier hamsters + 2 special characters128 hats29 hamster wheels3 multiplayer modesA focus and break timerA to-do listPlease share any bug reports or feedback about the demo on the Steam Community or in our Discord server!Hamk you!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T10:24:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656380688","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4663230-1842846814454907","game_id":"steam-4663230","kind":"announcement","title":"Adding More Wheels","summary":"As you may have noticed in our trailer, we didn't have that many hamster wheels back then.There were only five wheel skins...We couldn't possibly release the game like that, so we've been working hard to add as many new wheel skins as we can!Here are some GIFs of the wheels we've finished so far that we thought were just too cute not to share.Full Moon Wheel This wheel is a perfect match for the Moon Hamster or Star Hamster. Halloween Wheel The skull hat goes surprisingly well with it, too. Low-","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T07:31:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814454907","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4663230-1839041357034792","game_id":"steam-4663230","kind":"announcement","title":"Introducing Hamster Time","summary":"Hamllo!We'd like to introduce Hamster Time, your very own hamster companion that lives on your desktop!As you've probably seen on our Steam page, Hamster Time is a desktop companion game that stays on your screen while you use your computer.As you type on your keyboard or move your mouse, your hamster will happily run on its wheel, reacting to your activity in real time.You'll be able to collect all kinds of adorable hamsters—from ones with familiar coat patterns to unique hamsters inspired by f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T04:21:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357034792","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4663230":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:19:03Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:19:03Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4663230":"2026-10-26T03:19:03Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4663230":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:19:03Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:19:03Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5274260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:19:03Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:19:03Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4663230","app_id":4663230,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:46Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"24eb2ef3a91d697e30f026af615054994a1c03d65eb01cd47411e9bdf5a12a14","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"바탕화면 속 햄스터가 키보드와 마우스 입력에 맞춰 쳇바퀴를 달립니다. 친구들과 함께 컴퓨터로 작업하며 귀여운 햄스터와 멋진 쳇바퀴를 모아보세요. 다양한 멀